                 </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3>出玉率</h3>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:35%;\">出玉率<br>(25φ)</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:35%;\">出玉率<br>(30φ)</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定0</td>\n                            <td>－</td>\n                            <td>－</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>97.8%</td>\n                            <td>97.3%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>98.9%</td>\n                            <td>98.5%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                            <td>102.5%</td>\n                            <td>102.1%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>104.6%</td>\n                            <td>105.2%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>108.0%</td>\n                            <td>108.4%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n\n                <div class=\"caution\">\n                    <p>注意</p>\n                    <p>設定0は以下の挙動が見られます。</p>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li>下パネルが常時消灯</li>\n                        <li>音量が最小</li>\n                        <li>リール停止ボタンが緑色<br>(設定0以外は赤色)</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n\n\n        <p class=\"js-menu\">基本情報</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3>天井・打ち方・詳細情報</h3>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th style=\"width: 50%;\">項目</th>\n                            <th>記載</th>\n                        </tr><tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\"><a href=\"javascript:void(0);\" onclick=\"transitionScroll('https://slolaboratory.com/sゴーヤ-ハイエナ：詳細情報/', 44);\">天井情報</a></td>\n                            <td>ボーナス間天井<br>天国間天井</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\"><a href=\"javascript:void(0);\" onclick=\"transitionScroll('https://slolaboratory.com/sゴーヤ-基本情報/', 1);\">打ち方</a></td>\n                            <td>通常時の打ち方<br>ボーナス中の打ち方</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\"><a href=\"javascript:void(0);\" onclick=\"transitionScroll('https://slolaboratory.com/sゴーヤ-ハイエナ：詳細情報/');\">ハイエナ詳細情報</a></td>\n                            <td>その他のハイエナ情報</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n    \n\n        <p class=\"js-menu\">数値詳細</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination30\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2024-07-08\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                    ボーナス当選時のシーサーランプ</h3>\n                    <div class=\"update-date\" data-date=\"2024-07-08\">2024/07/08更新</div>\n                <p>ボーナス当選時のシーサーランプ点灯パターンで設定や天国を示唆する場合があります。</p>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th style=\"width:50%;\">点灯パターン</th>\n                            <th>示唆内容</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>右のみ点滅</td>\n                            <td>設定2以上濃厚<br>+天国濃厚</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>左のみ点滅</td>\n                            <td><span style=\"color:#0071C1;\">設定4以上濃厚</span><br>+天国濃厚</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>線香花火</td>\n                            <td><span style=\"color:#FE67FF;\">設定6濃厚</span><br>+天国濃厚</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n\n\n            <!--通常時-->\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination3\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2024-07-08\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                    にんじんA出現率</h3>\n                    <div class=\"update-date\" data-date=\"2024-07-08\">2024/07/08更新</div>\n                <p>にんじんAの出現率は高設定ほど出現しやすい模様です。</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination4\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2024-07-08\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                    成立役別のボーナス当選率</h3>\n                    <div class=\"update-date\" data-date=\"2024-07-08\">2024/07/08更新</div>\n                <p>通常時のボーナス抽選は内部状態の通常・ボーナス高確率によって当選率が変化し、内部状態が通常中のボーナス当選率に設定差があります。</p>\n\n                <h4>設定差のあるボーナス当選率</h4>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <caption>通常中</caption>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:25%;\">にんじんA</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:25%;\">にんじんB</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:25%;\">ゴーヤ</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>0.4%</td>\n                            <td>0.4%</td>\n                            <td>0.4%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>0.4%</td>\n                            <td>0.8%</td>\n                            <td>1.2%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                            <td>0.8%</td>\n                            <td>1.2%</td>\n                            <td>1.2%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>1.2%</td>\n                            <td>1.6%</td>\n                            <td>1.6%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>1.2%</td>\n                            <td>1.6%</td>\n                            <td>1.6%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n\n                <h4>設定差のないボーナス当選率</h4>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <caption>通常中</caption>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:25%;\">にんじん<br>揃い</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:25%;\">確定<br>にんじん</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:25%;\">リーチ目役</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td rowspan=\"5\">41%</td>\n                            <td rowspan=\"5\">100%</td>\n                            <td rowspan=\"5\">100%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination5\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2024-07-08\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                    ボーナス当選時の振り分け</h3>\n                    <div class=\"update-date\" data-date=\"2024-07-08\">2024/07/08更新</div>\n                <p>通常時のボーナス振り分けは、通常モード・天国モードで変化し、通常モード時のBIG比率に若干設定差があります。</p>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <caption>通常モード時のボーナス振り分け<br>(天国以外)</caption>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:33.3%;\">BIG</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:33.3%;\">REG</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>4.7%</td>\n                            <td>95.3%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>4.7%</td>\n                            <td>95.3%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                            <td>5.5%</td>\n                            <td>94.5%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>5.9%</td>\n                            <td>94.1%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>6.3%</td>\n                            <td>93.7%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n\n\n            <!--ボーナス中-->\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination6\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2024-07-08\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                    ナビ無し3枚役出現率</h3>\n                    <div class=\"update-date\" data-date=\"2024-07-08\">2024/07/08更新</div>\n                <p>ボーナス中のナビ無し3枚役は偶数設定かつ高設定ほど出現しやすい模様です。</p>\n                <p>なお、設定5は極端に出現率が低いようです。</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!---\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination4\"></h3>\n\n            </div>\n            -->   \n            \n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n\n\n        <p class=\"js-menu\" style=\"display: none;\">高設定狙いに必要な演出法則</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\" style=\"display: none;\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media.slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/24005602/noimage1.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n            </div>\n           \n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n        \n    </div>\n</div>","shukeiHtml":"","columns":[{"id":97007,"title":"Sご～やちゃんぷる～ 基本情報","date":"2024-06-05","cats":[54,57]},{"id":97002,"title":"Sご～やちゃんぷる～ ハイエナ：詳細情報","date":"2024-06-05","cats":[56,54,142]}]},"ev":null}